{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03057",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 8.33,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "Hello, take a seat, I'll be with you in a second. Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.66,
      "end_seconds": 16.97,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "Honestly, it's fever and shivers, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.92,
      "end_seconds": 21.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.73,
      "end_seconds": 35.71,
      "duration_seconds": 12.98,
      "text": "Ten days, I think... sorry, five days, I got that wrong. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.62,
      "end_seconds": 44.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.98,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.28,
      "end_seconds": 72.82,
      "duration_seconds": 27.54,
      "text": "It, It sort of comes and goes. About a four out of ten. There's confusion as well. I've had cloudy smelly urine too, for about a month. As for pain in the lower tummy, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.72,
      "end_seconds": 90.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Did you notice any fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.62,
      "end_seconds": 93.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "No. No fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.18,
      "end_seconds": 98.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "A few quick ones: back pain, cough or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.5,
      "end_seconds": 102.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.54,
      "end_seconds": 106.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.35,
      "end_seconds": 110.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.37,
      "end_seconds": 115.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Okay, do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.04,
      "end_seconds": 120.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Mm, I'm on a urinary catheter, in place."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.69,
      "end_seconds": 125.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.27,
      "end_seconds": 133.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "Yeah, my cousin has psoriasis. Erm, my father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.53,
      "end_seconds": 150.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.98,
      "end_seconds": 155.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "So, no, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.89,
      "end_seconds": 165.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.92,
      "end_seconds": 184.87,
      "duration_seconds": 18.95,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I have about eight cigarettes in a day. I look after my grandchildren most days. I live with my elderly mother. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.07,
      "end_seconds": 190.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.09,
      "end_seconds": 198.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "Oh, you know, I have an enlarged prostate, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.99,
      "end_seconds": 207.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "Alright, an enlarged prostate, that matches what I have here. Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.78,
      "end_seconds": 215.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.78,
      "end_seconds": 234.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.13,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 108 over 76, SpO2 98 percent on room air. And temperature 38.0, pulse 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.24,
      "end_seconds": 263.07,
      "duration_seconds": 16.83,
      "text": "From what you've told me, this is probably a catheter-related urinary infection. I'd also keep urosepsis in mind. Let me just check I've got this right. You've had fever and shivers for five days, and no cough or back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.9,
      "end_seconds": 265.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.16,
      "end_seconds": 273.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Blood tests is what I'd like next, for fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.65,
      "end_seconds": 278.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "When would that take place?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.09,
      "end_seconds": 299.9,
      "duration_seconds": 20.81,
      "text": "I'm going to order a urine culture, for possible urinary infection. I'll start you on co-amoxiclav, 625 milligrams, three times a day, seven days. That's for catheter urinary infection. Change the catheter and drink plenty. See me again in two days. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.46,
      "end_seconds": 305.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Okay, so okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}